摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Independent Shadow agent orchestration plugin for DeepSeek Harness","id":"gh:1344469282","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-shadow-mind","slug":"whutzefengxie-ops/dsh-shadow-mind","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Independent Shadow agent orchestration plugin for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-shadow-mind"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"中文 | English"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"An independently versioned DeepSeek Harness bundle that starts fresh background Shadow agents after "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"eligible tool-using root turns, validates their structured findings, relays accepted reports into th"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"e root session, and exposes configuration and evidence in the Web UI."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Version Compatibility"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| dsh-shadow-mind | DSH Version Required | Notes |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| v0.1.8 | `0.2.2-rc.1` | Desktop / Web, native review executor and Agent model selection |\n| v0.1.7"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" | `0.2.1-rc.2` | Desktop / Web, managed Shadow activation lifecycle |\n| v0.1.6 | `0.2.0-rc.2` | Con"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"figForms, profile settings, and think-first tool declaration fix |\n| v0.1.3–v0.1.4 | `0.1.6-alpha.2`"},{"id":"p7s4","text":" | Codec factories and Workspace-owned Session navigation |\n| v0.1.2         | `0.1.5-rc.2` (verifie"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"d baseline) | Subagent setup binding + live degenerate-output watchdog |\n| v0.1.1         | `>=0.1.5"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"-rc.1 <0.2.0` | Session API compatibility update |\n| v0.1.0         | `0.1.4` and earlier | Legacy s"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"` | Session API compatibility update |\n| v0.1.0         | `0.1.4` and earlier | Legacy session API |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"**Current release**: v0.1.8 targets DSH `0.2.2-rc.1` and Node.js `>=24.9.0`. Older DSH versions requ"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ire their matching plugin release; other versions require separate validation."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"If you're using DSH `0.1.4` or earlier, please install `dsh-shadow-mind@0.1.0`:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Inspiration"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The core design idea for this project comes from pi-shadow-mind. This repository is an independent i"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"mplementation for the DeepSeek Harness plugin system, not an official fork of that project. Its runt"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"ime, Sessions, subagents, permissions, persistence, and Web UI use DeepSeek Harness extension mechan"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"Sessions, subagents, permissions, persistence, and Web UI use DeepSeek Harness extension mechanisms."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Install the immutable release tag, or download the package tarball from the v0.1.8 Release:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Desktop"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Use the CLI bundled with the installed application and set `DSH_HOME` to the home actually used by D"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"esktop. Fully quit Desktop first and reopen it after the command finishes:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Desktop independently owns `profiles/desktop`. Installing into an npm CLI Web profile does not verif"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"y Desktop installation. After restarting, confirm the installed bundle on **Plugins**, then open **S"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ettings → Built-in Plugins → Shadow Mind**, then use a real file-reading tool turn to verify the rev"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"iew card. See the v0.1.8 compatibility notes for installation and rollback."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Or pin a reviewed commit when installing from GitHub:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Install a local checkout during development:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Restart the selected profile after installation. Verify the composed rows without starting the Web s"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"t the selected profile after installation. Verify the composed rows without starting the Web server:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The output must contain `shadow-mind-runtime` and `tool-shadow-mind`. Update by running `add` with a"},{"id":"p26s2","text":" new reviewed SHA. Remove the bundle with:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"GitHub installation consumes the committed `lib/` directory. This package has no `prepare` script an"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"d does not require pnpm `allowBuilds` authorization."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Configure"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Open **Settings → Plugins → Shadow Mind**. The page owns:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- live scheduling settings, including timeouts, report batching, model route, reasoning effort, disc"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"losure, and size limits;\n- Markdown-backed Shadow definitions, including name, activation probabilit"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"y, model filters, execution model, capture window, context inheritance, think-first execution, holdo"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"ut mode, tools, and prompt;\n- the latest review outcome for the currently selected root session;\n- c"},{"id":"p31s5","text":"atalog diagnostics and the local definition directory."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Definitions are stored in `$DSH_HOME/shadow-minds/*.md`. A minimal deterministic acceptance definiti"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"tions are stored in `$DSH_HOME/shadow-minds/*.md`. A minimal deterministic acceptance definition is:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Set the definition's `activation_probability` to `1` for deterministic acceptance. If `run_with_mode"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"l` is omitted, the child inherits the root route; set a complete `provider/model` route to use anoth"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"er model. The default Shadow tools are `read`, `grep`, and `glob`; definition tools extend that allo"},{"id":"p34s4","text":"wlist and may carry write authority if the inherited sandbox permits it. The disabled starter librar"},{"id":"p34s5","text":"y under `examples/shadow-minds/` demonstrates the anchored probe vocabulary and is never installed i"},{"id":"p34s6","text":"nto `$DSH_HOME` automatically."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Security and limitations"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"The default trajectory projection omits reasoning, raw tool-result text, and tool arguments. Prompt "},{"id":"p36s2","text":"injection remains possible in projected user and assistant text, so tool allowlists, inherited sandb"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"ox policy, fixed child approval policy, and disclosure limits remain security controls."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Definitions apply to one Harness home rather than one profile or workspace. Child Sessions follow th"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"e Harness persistence policy. Concurrent Shadows do not share a transaction, and write-capable tools"},{"id":"p37s3","text":" can race with the root agent or other Shadows."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"This plugin is developed and released from its own repository and is installed into a Harness profil"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"e as a bundle. An earlier in-repo copy of the plugin (`packages/shadow-mind` in the Harness source t"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"ree) predates this standalone repository and still uses the older `{status, content}` structured-out"},{"id":"p38s4","text":"put contract without `verdict`/`severity`/`refs`; it is not part of this repository's build or insta"},{"id":"p38s5","text":"ll path and is not updated here. Fixes in this repository apply to the released bundle only."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"Accepted reports and their anchored cards survive a service restart. Runtime counters, the latest-ru"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"n diagnostic, non-report lifecycle cards, and pause state are current-process data. The current rele"},{"id":"p39s3","text":"ase also resets `spentChars` on restart, so a restart can reopen a configured soft or hard budget be"},{"id":"p39s4","text":"fore the next real user message."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"Follow the installation and runtime validation plan for a reproducible source-host deployment, real-"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"model acceptance run, restart checks, and the budget-persistence remediation. See the target archite"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"cture, review conditioning, and review-quality directions for current runtime contracts. The setting"},{"id":"p40s4","text":"s field tiers document which Web form fields are required, common, advanced, or intentionally not ex"},{"id":"p40s5","text":"posed. The Chinese technical design retains the Pi reference analysis and independent release topolo"},{"id":"p40s6","text":"gy. See SECURITY.md before publishing logs or changing an installation pin."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

